:: Prison Punishment Rut


You drop through the darkness until cold water hits you hard. The impact drives you beneath the surface before you manage to come back up.
<<water>><<waterbr 2>><<effects>>

<<if pcAreArmsBound("both")>>
	With both arms bound, you kick through the water and twist your body towards the shore until your knees scrape against the shallows.
<<else>>
	You swim towards the nearest shore and pull yourself out of the water.
<</if>>
<br><br>

You stay still and listen for voices above, but nothing reaches you from the hole. As you catch your breath, you notice a sweet smell nearby.

<<if $worn.face.type.includes("blindfold")>>
	You can't see where it's coming from, but each breath brings more of the sweet smell. After breathing it for a short while, you stop panting and your shoulders begin to relax.<<lstress>><<stress -6>>
<<else>>
	A strange mushroom nearby releases a thin purple vapour. It looks dangerous, but the smell is sweet enough that you keep breathing it in without meaning to. After breathing it for a short while, you stop panting and your shoulders begin to relax.<<lstress>><<stress -6>>
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<set $rut_entry to "punish">>

<<link [[Inhale|Prison Rut Inhale]]>><<set $rut to 0>><<endevent>><<arousal 5000>><<drugs 300>><<stress -120>><</link>><<gggarousal>><<lllstress>>
<br>
<<link [[Ignore|Prison Rut]]>><<set $rut to 0>><<endevent>><</link>>
