:: Prison Punishment Shock
<<effects>>
The guard reaches into <<his>> shirt pocket. <span class="red">A terrible jolt runs through you,</span> emanating from your neck. It only lasts a moment, but it's enough to make you fall to the ground, and twitch.<<gtrauma>><<ggstress>><<gggpain>><<trauma 4>><<stress 8>><<pain 12>>
<br><br>
Your body is still shaking when <<he>> cuffs your wrists. You can't put up much resistance as <<he>> grabs your arm and hauls you back to your feet. The other inmates tease you as you pass, but it doesn't sound malicious.<<grespect>><<prison_inmates 1>>
<<bind>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Prison Punishment]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
